# BizTrack Nigeria - Supabase Environment Configuration
#
# FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# Create a .env.local file in the project root with:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-publishable-or-anon-key
#
# FOR VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# In Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables, configure:
#
# 1. Project URL:
#    Name: VITE_SUPABASE_URL (or SUPABASE_URL)
#    Value: https://your-project-id.supabase.co
#
# 2. Project Key (Publishable / Anon key):
#    Name: VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (or VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY or SUPABASE_ANON_KEY)
#    Value: your-publishable-or-anon-key
#
# Apply to: Production, Preview, Development
# Note: Always trigger a "Redeploy" in Vercel after adding/updating environment variables!
